{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">Logical values</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310006","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Logical-values.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Logical-values.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"Logical-values\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">Logical values</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Represent values of logical expressions.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"Logical-values__syntax_GC18V62696406\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d454771e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"Logical-values__idGDM2LU2672442\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> YES <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> TRUE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> NO <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> FALSE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">YES <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> TRUE</dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A value that signifies a valid result for a logical expression.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">NO <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> FALSE</dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A value that signifies an invalid result for a logical expression.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"Logical-values__note_GC18V72696422\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d454771e175\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">You must\nuse these values in a procedure even if alternate values are given in\nthe FORMAT specification for a field or variable.</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LOGICAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LOGICAL-function.html\">LOGICAL function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LOOKUP-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LOOKUP-function.html\">LOOKUP function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310006","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"Logical values","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Logical-values.html","type":"Manual"}